@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Schedule with a default: 90 minutes at $60/hour

participant ":LessonCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data
participant "student:Student" as Student
participant "lesson:Lesson" as Lesson

[-> Commands : execute("schedule S1 ... dur/90")
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getStudent("S1")
Data --> Commands : student
Commands -> Commands : parse and validate input
activate Commands
Commands --> Commands
deactivate Commands
Commands -> Data : addLesson(..., null, 90)
activate Data
Data -> Data : validateDuration(90)
activate Data
Data --> Data
deactivate Data
Data -> Student : getDefaultHourlyRate()
Student --> Data : 60
Data -> Data : fee = 60 x 90 / 60\ntotal: 90.00
activate Data
Data --> Data : fee
deactivate Data
create Lesson
Data -> Lesson : new Lesson(..., fee, ..., 90)
Data -> Data : ensureSlotFree(lesson)
activate Data
Data --> Data
deactivate Data
Data -> Data : putLesson(lesson)
activate Data
Data --> Data
deactivate Data
Data --> Commands : lesson
deactivate Data
Commands -->[ : Scheduled L1 ... $90.00
deactivate Commands
note over Commands, Lesson
  The main loop then saves changed data.
  The stored fee is independent of later rate changes.
end note
@enduml
